        <mxCell id="c77" value="&lt;i&gt;Report view, page Ex 13.2, for fiscal 2026. Outlined: Brown LLC, which grouping by name makes one customer of two (CustomerIDs 173 and 5) and so places in the top ten, and Willis and Sons, the tenth customer by key, whom grouping by name pushes out. The two lists differ by that one customer.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="366" width="860" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
